{{Term/Store|Sand Boots|Sand Boots|Series, BotW, TotK, AoC|plural}} are recurring [[Item]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK, AoC}}<ref name="BotW Inventory"/><ref name="TotK Inventory"/><ref name="AoC Allies"/>

==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Descriptions BotW}}
Sand Boots grant the [[Sand Speed Up]] [[Added Effect]], allowing [[Link#Breath of the Wild|Link]] to travel more quickly across sandy ground, such as the [[Gerudo Desert]] or beach areas.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> They can also be worn in [[Gerudo Town]] (in conjunction with the [[Gerudo Top]] and [[Gerudo Veil]]).

To get the Sand Boots, [[Link]] must speak to [[Bozai]], who can be found jogging around Gerudo Town. Link must wear the complete [[Gerudo Outfit]] to initiate a [[Side Quest]] called [[The Eighth Heroine]]. Link will temporarily be given [[Snow Boots]] for this quest. Once Link has ventured to the [[Gerudo Highlands]] and taken a picture of the [[Statue of the Eighth Heroine]], he must show it to Bozai. Link will trade back the Snow Boots and be given the Sand Boots.<ref name="BotW Bozai"/> After acquiring them, [[Granté]] will begin to sell the Sand Boots in [[Tarrey Town]].

The Sand Boots are not required to complete any Quests in the game, but Link will be able to access [[The Forgotten Sword]] quest after obtaining them.

