==={{AoC|-}}===
{{Noncanon|Start}}
{{Descriptions AoC}}
The Sand Boots are a piece of [[Attire]] obtained when the [[Warrior]]s complete the [[Quest]] "[[Surveying the Desert Ruins]]". It can only be worn by [[Link]], and can be [[Dye]]d at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]]. They are modified by [[Gerudo]] artisans to allow normal movement in sand.<ref name="AoC Allies"/>

